>My address is ... <br />My e-mail is ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I'd like to book a flight to Sydney, Australia, please.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "A one-way ticket from Boston to Australia. How much is it?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My credit card number is 2345 9066 5743.  The expiry date is April 2023.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My e-mail address is correybrown@mail.com.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to book ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make arrangements for a specific time in the future. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like to book a flight to Mexico in May.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you book a flight.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "direct flight ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "going straight from one place to another without stopping  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is there a direct flight to Mexico?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "one-way ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "traveling from one place to another, but not back again ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Would you like a one-way ticket?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le05ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "round-trip ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "traveling from one place to another and back to where you started ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Would you like a round-trip ticket?",